[TITLE]
Descriptions on every element kind -- the fixture for ROADMAP Task 674.
EPA's own Net1, Net2 and Net3 carry a BARE trailing `;` on every data row and no
description at all, so there is nothing in this tree to open in order to see the
feature work. Hand-written for that: every element carries a description, one of
them carries a `;` inside it, and the network solves.
Import it, read the Description row in each popup and the Description column in
each table, then export and confirm every sentence comes back on the end of its
own row. dev/lpn-spike/identity-band-harness.js asserts the same thing headlessly.

